      "HolographicCard (floating data card, drei Html content)",
      "HolographicPanel (curved content surface)",
      "NavigationButtonGrid (5 physical nav buttons: HOME/LABS/ARCADE/SETTINGS/PROFILE)",
      "VariableDialCluster (3 auto-reconfiguring page-context dials)",
      "CenterViewportScreen (spherical panoramic r=3.9, 144x72 segs)"
